Synthetic data
  GS-03 (src/data/gs03.ts) and the fixtures in tools/lanl/fixtures/ are
  invented for this project. They describe no real organisation, person or
  system.
  The sample case (src/data/sample-case.json) and the worked example
  (src/data/worked-example.ts) are simulated. They name the author's own
  organisation and product, PHANG Group and InfoPro; the events, accounts and
  systems are invented, and InfoPro has had no such incident.
